      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "product_identity"
      ],
      "text": "再考虑 replacement detail 的边界:不能简单永远丢 superseded 明细。若 paid canonical 单本身有 ExportStoreFee 明细,优先且只用 paid 明细;但若 paid 单没有明细而 pending 被替换单有,应把一个最优 superseded source 作为该 canonical 单的货号证据,否则会无谓退回 CENTRAL_POOL。建议 canonical_detail_source 每个 canonical bill 只选一个 source bill:canonical 自身有明细优先,否则按 source_income_bill_ids 顺序选首个有明细;绝不同时用两份。coverage/audit 同样按这个选择。加 fixture 测“paid无明细、pending有明细可继承但不重复”。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_c64f1a54ec253b880938_6d210567335b1904c6ae"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "45d4d058964e0e638cf5f1d738ff5862c5c43243cc040672b8b814c65a83164a",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
