      "risk": "low",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.product_identity.65adb84e494f",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "product_identity"
      ],
      "text": "补充一个关键边界:product detail 层也要按 canonical 账单过滤/归属,不能让 superseded 等待支付单的明细与已支付单明细重复进入货号分布。若 canonical 当日有多个都已支付的真实账单,则保留各自明细并合并到当日总额。coverage/audit 应以 canonical bill/day 为准。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_b9af23c9f962b934cf54_45d4d058964e0e638cf5"
    },
